measuring_overlay.png is from the waywall generic config by Arjun Gore
(gore), used under the MIT Licence.

    https://github.com/gorebutcher/waywall-config

It is a 1920x1080 frame whose measuring band is exactly 576px wide - 18 bands
of 32px - centred on x=960. Those numbers matter: see "Measuring window" in
the README for the geometry that keeps a band equal to one game pixel.
